cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use REPLATFORM in research or a commercial product, please cite it as below."
title: "REPLATFORM"
abstract: >-
  A local Windows platform for reverse engineering and malware triage:
  static PE/APK analysis, YARA matching, Ghidra/Rizin integration, batch
  scanning, diffing, constrained AI agents, and a token-protected local web UI.
  Untrusted samples are never executed on the host by default; dynamic analysis
  is restricted to Windows Sandbox with explicit confirmation.
type: software
version: 1.5.2
date-released: 2026-10-27
license: MIT
